#. module: liber_gdrive
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/liber_gdrive/services/gdrive_api.py:0
msgid ""
"Drive folders are addressed by ID: open the folder in the browser and copy "
"the ID from its URL into the folder's External ID field."
msgstr ""
"As pastas do Drive são endereçadas por ID: abra a pasta no navegador e "
"copie o ID da URL dela para o campo ID externo da pasta."

