#. module: liber_gdrive
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:liber_gdrive.field_liber_cloud_folder__provider
msgid ""
"Which storage holds this folder. Provider modules add their entry here."
msgstr ""
"Qual armazenamento guarda esta pasta. Os módulos de provedor acrescentam "
"sua entrada aqui."

#. module: liber_gdrive
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:liber_gdrive.field_liber_cloud_account__provider
msgid ""
"Which storage this credential opens. Provider modules add their entry here."
msgstr ""
"Qual armazenamento esta credencial abre. Os módulos de provedor "
"acrescentam sua entrada aqui."
